The testcase is to configure Kdump to dump vmcore to a SSH server. It can be
used in a multihost test to configure Kdump on client side, and setup SSH
server on server side. Alternatively used in a single host test by specifying
your SSH server via param 'SSH_SERVER'.

Accepted parameter:

- SSH_SERVER
	Run as STANDALONE task

- SSH_KEY
	Corresponding to 'sshkey' in kdump.conf

- RESTRICTED_SHELL
	Configure a restricted shell login in ssh host
